OL,3,GNEWSAQuicker cemetery repairs urged by
OL,4,Avolunteer group
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers that promote a cemetery's
OL,7,Fhistory have urged a council to move
OL,8,Ffaster to repair parts of it.
OL,10,FThe Reading Old Cemetery History,
OL,11,FHeritage and Education group works to
OL,12,Funcover and share the stores of the
OL,13,F18,000 people who were buried at the
OL,14,Fsite from 1843.
OL,16,FYota Dimitriadi, from the group, said
OL,17,Fit wants Reading Borough Council to
OL,18,Fprovide a timeline for repairs at the
OL,19,FGrade II listed site and its Cemetery
OL,20,FArch.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
